    "tree_id": "5f12998f24ea1cd21062480e8849c9396276759b",
    "message": "wp433: chot dich ghi credential NLM (W1-W3) va ~/.tra_luat_config.json (W6) cua tl_gws\n\nPacket #433 NLM-GWS-DICH-NGOAI-KHO r1 g1 (spec sha256 3721e468...).\n\n- _kiem_dich_ghi: dich phai ngoai kho git (qua _trong_kho_git) va khong\n  thanh phan nao tu goc dich toi chinh tep dich la symlink.\n- _kiem_jar_nlm: khoa nlm_auth phai bang nguyen van mot phan tu\n  _NLM_AUTH_RELS; gia tri la str encode UTF-8 duoc.\n- W1/W2/W3: kiem jar + dich cua moi khoa truoc khi ghi; ghi nguyen tu\n  tung tep bang _ghi_nguyen_tu_0600.\n- W6: chot dich truoc lan doc phuc vu merge; ghi nguyen tu; khong luu\n  nlm_auth bi tu choi vao config; loi ghi config dat degraded (rc 1).\n- Moi lan tu choi in dung mot dong \"[the] x <cum>: <chi tiet repr>\".\n- Fragment wp433_nlm_gws_dich_ngoai_kho: 18 ca, 30 dot bien theo bang\n  4b cua dac ta, phan hang theo (ca, luot, nhan); bundled tai sinh bang\n  generate_bundled_module_bytes (ngoai le co uy quyen cua chu kho).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Gtxrc8gnsVH6di9W6eJsd",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-18T10:35:30Z",
